---
import ToolPage from '../../../layouts/ToolPage.astro';

const steps = [
  'Paste a Unix timestamp, like <code>1700000000</code>. Seconds, milliseconds, microseconds and nanoseconds are told apart by how many digits they have. You can also paste a date like <code>2024-01-01T10:00:00Z</code>, or type words like <code>tomorrow 9am</code> or <code>3 hours ago</code>.',
  'The big card shows that moment as a date in your time zone, in UTC, and how far it is from now. Click the Unix seconds, milliseconds or ISO value to copy it.',
  'Below it, see the same moment in four cities. Pick any city from its menu. Open “Code” for ready-to-paste JavaScript, Postgres and Python.',
];

const faq = [
  { q: 'What is a Unix timestamp?', a: 'The number of seconds since 1 January 1970 at midnight UTC, the “Unix epoch”. It is the same everywhere in the world at the same moment, which is why databases and APIs use it. <code>1700000000</code> is 14 November 2023, 22:13:20 UTC.' },
  { q: 'Is my timestamp in seconds or milliseconds?', a: 'Count the digits. Today in seconds is <strong>10 digits</strong> (like <code>1793560000</code>); in milliseconds it is <strong>13</strong>. JavaScript’s <code>Date.now()</code> gives milliseconds; Postgres, Python and most APIs use seconds. This tool works it out for you and says which one it read.' },
  { q: 'Why is my date off by a few hours?', a: 'Almost always a time zone mix-up. A timestamp has no time zone, but the moment you show it as a date, your code picks one: the browser’s, the server’s (often UTC), or the database’s. Compare the “your time zone” and “UTC” lines here to see which one you are getting.' },
  { q: 'Why does my date say 1970?', a: 'You passed seconds where milliseconds were expected. <code>new Date(1700000000)</code> in JavaScript is 20 January 1970, because it reads the number as milliseconds. Multiply by 1000: <code>new Date(1700000000 * 1000)</code>.' },
  { q: 'What does “Z” at the end of a date mean?', a: 'It means UTC (“Zulu time”). <code>2024-01-01T10:00:00Z</code> is 10am in London in winter, and 3:30pm in India. A date written with <code>+05:30</code> instead carries its own offset.' },
  { q: 'Is anything uploaded?', a: 'No. Everything runs in your browser, using your browser’s own time zone data.' },
];
---
<ToolPage
  slug="timestamp-converter"
  title="Unix timestamp converter, with time zones · Darnly"
  description="Convert a Unix timestamp to a date, or a date to a timestamp. Seconds or milliseconds detected automatically, shown in your time zone, UTC and four cities, with JavaScript, Postgres and Python code. Free."
  h1="Unix timestamp converter"
  lede="Paste a timestamp, a date or plain words like “tomorrow 9am”. See it as a readable date in your time zone, in UTC, and in four cities, with a live clock of the current Unix time."
  steps={steps}
  faq={faq}
>
  <div class="ts">
    <div class="stage" aria-label="Your time, live">
      <div class="entry">
        <label class="sr" for="ts-in">Timestamp, date or words</label>
        <input id="ts-in" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" placeholder="1700000000, 2024-01-01 or tomorrow 9am" />
        <button id="ts-now-btn" type="button" class="primary">Now</button>
      </div>
      <div class="tries">
        <span>Try:</span>
        <button type="button" data-ts-try="1700000000">1700000000</button>
        <button type="button" data-ts-try="1700000000000">1700000000000</button>
        <button type="button" data-ts-try="2024-01-01T10:00:00Z">2024-01-01T10:00:00Z</button>
        <button type="button" data-ts-try="tomorrow 9am">tomorrow 9am</button>
        <button type="button" data-ts-try="3 hours ago">3 hours ago</button>
      </div>
      <p class="bad" id="ts-error" role="alert" hidden>We couldn’t read that. Try a number like 1700000000, a date like 2024-01-01 10:00, or words like “next friday 5pm”.</p>

      <div class="answer" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="read" id="ts-read" hidden></span>
        <span class="date" id="ts-date"></span>
        <span class="time" id="ts-time"></span>
        <span class="zone" id="ts-zone"></span>
        <div class="sub">
          <span class="rel" id="ts-rel"></span>
          <span class="utc" id="ts-utc"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="chips">
        <div class="chip-box"><span>Unix seconds</span><button type="button" class="chip" id="ts-sec" title="Copy"></button></div>
        <div class="chip-box"><span>Milliseconds</span><button type="button" class="chip" id="ts-ms" title="Copy"></button></div>
        <div class="chip-box wide"><span>ISO 8601 (UTC)</span><button type="button" class="chip" id="ts-iso" title="Copy"></button></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ticker">
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="tick-label">Unix time right now</span>
      <button type="button" class="tick" id="ts-tick" title="Copy">0</button>
      <span class="tick-ms"><span id="ts-tick-ms">0</span> ms</span>
      <label class="pick">
        <span>Or pick a date</span>
        <input id="ts-pick" type="datetime-local" step="60" />
      </label>
    </div>

    <section class="cities-wrap" aria-labelledby="ts-cities-h">
      <h2 id="ts-cities-h">The same moment around the world</h2>
      <div class="cities" id="ts-cities"></div>
    </section>

    <details class="fold">
      <summary>Every format</summary>
      <p class="hint">Click a value to copy it.</p>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table><tbody id="ts-formats"></tbody></table>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="fold">
      <summary>Code: JavaScript, Postgres and Python</summary>
      <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Language">
        <button type="button" role="tab" data-ts-lang="js" aria-selected="true">JavaScript</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" data-ts-lang="postgres" aria-selected="false">Postgres / Supabase</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" data-ts-lang="python" aria-selected="false">Python</button>
      </div>
      <pre id="ts-code" tabindex="0" aria-label="Code for this time"></pre>
      <div class="actions"><button id="ts-copy-code" type="button" class="primary">Copy code</button></div>
    </details>

    <div class="actions">
      <button id="ts-link" type="button" class="ghost">Copy link to this time</button>
      <p class="status" id="ts-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</ToolPage>

<script>
  import '../../../scripts/timestamp-converter';
</script>

<style>
  .ts { display: grid; gap: 24px; min-width: 0; }
  .ts [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .stage { display: grid; gap: 18px; padding: 32px; border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--wash); min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .entry { display: flex; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }
  .entry input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: 600 22px/1.2 var(--mono); padding: 14px 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); }
  .entry input:focus { outline: 3px solid var(--pink); outline-offset: 1px; }
  .entry input[aria-invalid="true"] { border-color: #B4234F; }
  .tries { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 6px 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .tries button { font: 500 13px/1 var(--mono); padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; }
  .tries button:hover { border-color: var(--sky); }
  .bad { margin: 0; color: #B4234F; font-size: 15px; }
  .answer { display: grid; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; padding: 8px 0; }
  .read { justify-self: start; font: 700 12px/1 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--sky); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #DDF2FA; }
  .date { font: 800 44px/1.05 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--ink); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .time { font: 800 72px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--sky); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .zone { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .sub { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 16px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .rel { font: 700 16px/1 var(--body); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--pink); color: var(--white); }
  .utc { font: 500 15px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--ink); }
  .chips { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr); gap: 12px; }
  .chip-box { display: grid; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; }
  .chip-box span { font: 700 12px/1 var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .chip { font: 600 16px/1.2 var(--mono); padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px dashed var(--ink-soft); background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); cursor: copy; text-align: left; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .chip:hover { border-color: var(--pink); }
  .ticker { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 14px; padding: 14px 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--ink); color: #E6F6FB; }
  .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3DDC97; animation: pulse 1s infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes pulse { to { opacity: 0.3; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dot { animation: none; } }
  .tick-label { font-size: 14px; color: #A9C7D3; }
  .tick { font: 700 24px/1 var(--mono); padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; color: var(--white); cursor: copy; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .tick-ms { font: 500 13px/1 var(--mono); color: #A9C7D3; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .pick { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-left: auto; font-size: 14px; color: #A9C7D3; }
  .pick input { font: 500 14px/1 var(--body); padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #2B4A5A; border-radius: 10px; background: #132F40; color: var(--white); color-scheme: dark; }
  .cities-wrap h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font: 700 20px/1.2 var(--display); }
  .cities { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .cities :global(.city) { display: grid; gap: 6px; padding: 16px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); min-width: 0; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .cities :global(.city[data-sky="day"]) { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #FFF6D9, #DDF2FA); color: var(--ink); }
  .cities :global(.city[data-sky="dusk"]) { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #FBD9C9, #E3D6F5); color: var(--ink); }
  .cities :global(.city[data-sky="night"]) { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0B2230, #23395B); color: #E6F6FB; border-color: #23395B; }
  .cities :global(select) { justify-self: start; max-width: 100%; font: 600 15px/1.2 var(--body); padding: 4px 6px; margin-left: -6px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .cities :global(select option) { color: var(--ink); background: var(--white); }
  .cities :global(.city-time) { font: 800 30px/1 var(--display); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cities :global(.city-day) { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .cities :global(.city-off) { font: 500 12px/1 var(--mono); opacity: 0.75; }
  .fold { padding: 4px 20px 16px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--white); min-width: 0; }
  .fold summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 0 8px; }
  .hint { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  table :global(th) { text-align: left; font: 600 14px/1.3 var(--body); color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
  table :global(td) { padding: 4px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  table :global(.val) { font: 500 14px/1.4 var(--mono); padding: 6px 8px; margin-left: -8px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: none; color: var(--ink); cursor: copy; text-align: left; }
  table :global(.val:hover) { background: var(--wash); }
  .tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 4px 0 12px; }
  .tabs button { font: 600 14px/1 var(--body); padding: 9px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; }
  .tabs button[aria-selected="true"] { background: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink); color: var(--white); }
  pre { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 16px; border-radius: 14px; overflow: auto; background: var(--ink); color: #E6F6FB; font: 400 13px/1.6 var(--mono); font-variant-ligatures: none; white-space: pre; }
  .sr { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .primary { font: 600 15px/1 var(--body); padding: 12px 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); cursor: pointer; }
  .entry .primary { border-radius: 14px; padding: 0 22px; font-size: 16px; }
  .ghost { font: 600 15px/1 var(--body); padding: 10px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; }
  .ghost:hover { border-color: var(--sky); }
  .status { margin: 0; min-height: 1.6em; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .cities { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .chips { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .chip-box.wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .pick { margin-left: 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .stage { padding: 20px; }
    .entry input { font-size: 17px; padding: 12px 14px; }
    .date { font-size: 28px; }
    .time { font-size: 48px; }
    .cities :global(.city-time) { font-size: 24px; }
    .chip { font-size: 14px; padding: 10px; }
  }
</style>
